{# The parameter-direction section, shared by every engine template that #}
{# feeds the parameter-direction readings. Parameterized by (findings list, #}
{# heading text) so each template passes its own heading text. The body is #}
{# verbatim-pinned by the section suite in src/lib.rs — wording or formatting #}
{# drift fails CI. #}
{# The seam capability records (#357 fan-out): one admission line per #}
{# family this section feeds — the engine facets behind it, as the capability #}
{# probe answers them — quoted from the held seam report. Each rides exactly #}
{# one "Analysis engine:" line, after the coverage line, beside the entries; #}
{# when the section filed nothing at all the line rides under the heading, #}
{# the heading opening for the first line that needs it. An answerable or #}
{# undeclared family renders exactly what it rendered before. #}
{% macro parameter_direction_section(findings, heading, coverage, decompilation_cap, disassembly_cap, caller_edges_cap) %}
{% if !findings.is_empty() %}
## {{ heading }}

Which way data flows through this function's pointer parameters, read from
its body by static analysis. Give each parameter the Rust shape its
direction names — an `in` parameter a shared borrow, an `out` parameter a
mutable borrow or a value handed back to the caller, an `inout` parameter
a read-modify-write through a mutable borrow — and add no mutability a
direction reading does not claim:

{% for finding in findings %}
- **{{ finding.parameter }} is {{ finding.direction|safe }}** (via {{ finding.method }}, confidence {{ finding.confidence }})
  Evidence: `{{ finding.evidence|safe }}`
{% endfor %}

{% endif %}
{% if !coverage.admission.is_empty() %}
{% if findings.is_empty() %}
## {{ heading }}

{% endif %}
Coverage: {{ coverage.admission }}

{% endif %}
{% if !decompilation_cap.is_empty() %}
{% if findings.is_empty() %}
{% if coverage.admission.is_empty() %}
## {{ heading }}

{% endif %}
{% endif %}
Analysis engine: {{ decompilation_cap }}

{% endif %}
{% if !disassembly_cap.is_empty() %}
{% if findings.is_empty() %}
{% if coverage.admission.is_empty() %}
{% if decompilation_cap.is_empty() %}
## {{ heading }}

{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
Analysis engine: {{ disassembly_cap }}

{% endif %}
{% if !caller_edges_cap.is_empty() %}
{% if findings.is_empty() %}
{% if coverage.admission.is_empty() %}
{% if decompilation_cap.is_empty() %}
{% if disassembly_cap.is_empty() %}
## {{ heading }}

{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
Analysis engine: {{ caller_edges_cap }}

{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}